WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:10.100
Track what the mall pays its suppliers, see which contracts reach their notice date, and renew or end them on time.

2
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:16.840
Contracts holds the mall's service contracts, security, cleaning, insurance and more, next to the tenant leases.

3
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:23.790
What the mall pays a year, renewals due and what ends in the next ninety days.

4
00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:32.450
Renewals due lists the contracts whose notice date has arrived. Decide now, before they renew or lapse by themselves.

5
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.490
Open the contract.

6
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:41.330
The supplier, value, billing, notice period and who in the office owns it.

7
00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:45.730
To keep it, choose Renew.

8
00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:52.640
The new end date is a year on. Change it if you agreed a different term.

9
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:56.270
Enter the new value if the price changed.

10
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:59.170
Renew the contract.

11
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:08.970
The renewal is recorded in its history. If it is not working out, Terminate ends it on a chosen day with the reason.
